[66.0, "o", "   {\"advice\":\"Yes - for hazy day, indoor options near Woodlands include: 1) Indoor Mall Walking Club at Woodlands Civic Centre on Sat 8:00am, 60 min, moderate; 2) Low-Impact Aerobics for Beginners at Woodlands Sport Centre on Thu 9:00am, 50 min, moderate; 3) Morning Chair Strength & Balance at Woodlands Community Club on Tue 8:30am, 45 min, light. Since you have elevated blood glucose and low daily steps, the Diabetes Prevention Programme intake session on Sat 9:30am is also a good pick. I can't sign you up yet unless you clearly say yes to one activity.\",\"confidence\":\"high\",\"supporting_guides\":[\"lg-02-physical-activity-guideline\",\"lg-06-exercise-by-condition\",\"lg-09-hazy-day-activity\",\"lg-05-eating-for-pre-diabetes\"],\"rationale\":\"Resident is 60-64, in North/Woodlands, hazy today (PSI 60), with elevated blood glucose and low activity levels, so indoor hazy-day-safe activities and pre-diabetes-friendly options fit best. Programme intake is available, but registration needs a clear yes for a specific activity.\",\"personalisation_flags\":[\"age_60_to_64\",\"region_north\",\"planning_area_woodlands\",\"hazy_today\",\"screening_risk_high\",\"elevated_blood_glucose\",\"low_steps\",\"low_mvpa\",\"disengaged\"]}\r\n"]
