[138.688, "o", "   [livewell-test-coach v1] 34.1s  tools: get_citizen_profile, memory:search_call, livewell-nutrition, livewell-activity, memory:search_call, memory:search_call  model: gpt-5.4-mini\r\n"]
[138.688, "o", "   {\"advice\":\"Here's a simple weekly plan for your glucose results.\\n\\nFood:\\n- Follow the plate rule: 1/2 vegetables/fruit, 1/4 wholegrain staple, 1/4 protein.\\n- Keep regular meals, choose water or kopi/teh kosong, and ask for less gravy, sauce and soup.\\n- 7-day simple plan:\\n  - Day 1: Oats + plain yoghurt; brown-rice fish with greens; tofu-vegetable soup.\\n  - Day 2: Wholemeal toast + egg; chicken, brown rice and vegetables; chapati with dhal and salad.\\n  - Day 3: Oats + fruit; economy rice with brown rice, 2 vegetables, fish and less gravy; yong tau foo soup.\\n  - Day 4: Egg and tomato toast; tofu, vegetables and brown rice; clear fish soup.\\n  - Day 5: Plain yoghurt + fruit; wholegrain noodles with chicken and greens; omelette and salad.\\n  - Day 6: Oats; chapati, vegetables and fish; brown rice, tofu and greens.\\n  - Day 7: Wholemeal toast + egg; chicken rice with modest rice and extra cucumber; vegetable-bean soup.\\n- If hungry, choose unsalted nuts or fruit.\\n\\nExercise:\\n- Because your screening risk is high, check with a doctor before starting or increasing exercise.\\n- Keep all sessions indoors while hazy.\\n- 7-day morning plan:\\n  - Mon: 10-minute easy indoor walk + gentle stretching.\\n  - Tue: Chair strength & balance, lightly.\\n  - Wed: Two 10-minute indoor walks, easy pace.\\n  - Thu: Low-impact aerobics, with breaks.\\n  - Fri: 10-minute indoor walk + 5 sit-to-stands and 5 wall push-ups.\\n  - Sat: Indoor mall walking, start with 20-30 minutes.\\n  - Sun: Rest, or ge...\r\n"]
